            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Trúc Mây Sa Pa",
            "review_text": "Charles L\nLercara Friddi, Italy196 contributions\n0\nGood and cheap restaurant in central Sapa\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nThe location of the restaurant is very good, right on the side of Sapa's small garden. The food is tasty and very cheap, recommended the fried rice and chicken with BBQ sauce. The juices and smoothies are good as well!\nWritten March 4, 2020\ngiaback l\nThank you for taking the time to share such a lovely review with us. It means a lot to know that you enjoyed the food, especially the fried rice and chicken with BBQ sauce.\n\nI’m also very happy to hear that you liked our juices and smoothies. As the person behind the kitchen, I always hope that what comes from our stove feels simple, fresh, and satisfying — the kind of food you can enjoy after a day exploring Sa Pa.\n\nWe’re lucky to be surrounded by local people who help bring good ingredients into our kitchen, and it makes us happy when those ingredients become part of a guest’s experience here.\n\nAnd yes, being right beside the little garden is one of the things we love about our location too. Thank you for recommending us, and if your travels bring you back to Sa Pa, we’d be very happy to welcome you again. 🌿\nRead more\nWritten August 22, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
